{"title":"Career Roadmap — Donor Coordinator","role":"Donor Coordinator","summary":"A Donor Coordinator works on the operational and communication side of blood donation. The role involves identifying and communicating with potential donors, organizing donation appointments and camps, maintaining donor records, coordinating pre-donation procedures, supporting donor retention, and ensuring that donation activities follow applicable blood-bank protocols.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences — B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.","Course":"Blood Banking Technology / Transfusion Technology"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Workplaces","text":"Blood banks, hospitals, transfusion centres, blood donation organizations, medical colleges, NGOs, blood collection camps"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Donor Coordinator works on the operational and communication side of blood donation. The role involves identifying and communicating with potential donors, organizing donation appointments and camps, maintaining donor records, coordinating pre-donation procedures, supporting donor retention, and ensuring that donation activities follow applicable blood-bank protocols."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Donor communication and counselling"},{"text":"Blood donation camp coordination"},{"text":"Donor registration and documentation"},{"text":"Pre-donation screening support"},{"text":"Blood-bank workflow coordination"},{"text":"Donor recruitment and retention"},{"text":"Data management and reporting"},{"text":"Public awareness and outreach"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact clinical responsibilities depend on the candidate's qualification, institution, and authorized scope of practice."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Horizon 1 — Donor Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"